  "metaDescription": "Indonesian police have dismissed Irjen Ahrie Sonta following findings of illegal wiretapping directed at President Prabowo Subianto.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Indonesian National Police has officially dismissed Irjen Ahrie Sonta after an ethics panel found him guilty of illegal wiretapping against President Prabowo Subianto.",
