    "Bareskrim is currently investigating potential treason allegations stemming from the illegal wiretapping case, with further ethics hearings scheduled for next week."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police have taken disciplinary action against Irjen Ahrie Sonta, leading to his dismissal following an ethics hearing that confirmed his involvement in the illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. Following the ruling, the officer has initiated an appeal process. The case has expanded to involve four active-duty generals who have been identified as suspects in the broader investigation. Among those facing upcoming ethics proceedings is a former National Police Chief. The investigation, led by Bareskrim, is now probing potential allegations of treason connected to these surveillance activities. Academics have characterized the breach as a significant matter regarding national security. The process is being monitored by the National Police Commission (Kompolnas), which noted that the proceedings have adhered to established protocols and standards of accountability.",
